fixed_reference_contracts.rs, support/fixed_reference_replay.rs and
support/fixed_reference_networks.rs are adapted from itpyi/magna,
revision 56847478c840395735146ef1e1ccdc3d8aedc10f:

tests/core/test_file_reuse.py
tests/core/test_incremental_history.py
tests/core/test_query_reuse.py
